INSERT INTO `comments` (`id`, `author`, `comment`, `timestamp`, `task_id`, `updated`) VALUES (1,'Chaitanya','Will start working on it ASAP...','2026-07-08 23:08:13.329134',14,_binary '\0'),(2,'Chaitanya','Got the issue','2026-07-08 23:08:54.588624',14,_binary ''),(3,'System User','Testing in progress','2026-07-08 23:26:55.459369',12,_binary '\0'),(4,'Chaitanya','Looking into this issue','2026-07-08 23:34:22.503431',17,_binary ''),(5,'Chaitanya','If user dont want to pass optional fields [ Priority , Status ] then just have to remove them from request paylaod.\nPFA sample payload without them.\n{\n  \"title\":\"SELFTEST INITIAL DEV\",\n  \"description\":\"HLSW500 REQ IS TESTED\",\n  \"taskType\": \"STORY\",\n  \"assignee\":\"SANKALP\",\n  \"reporter\":\"CHAITANYA\",\n  \"createdBy\":\"CHAITANYA\" \n}','2026-07-09 02:09:46.411259',14,_binary '\0'),(6,'Sankalp','Assigning this story to begin testing of create comment api','2026-07-09 06:19:46.677020',22,_binary '\0'),(7,'Sankalp','API type -- POST\n\nSample Payload - \n{\"taskId\":22,\"comment\":\"Assigning this story to begin testing of create comment api\",\"author\":\"Sankalp\"}\nSample Response - \n{\n    \"id\": 6,\n    \"comment\": \"Assigning this story to begin testing of create comment api\",\n    \"author\": \"Sankalp\",\n    \"taskId\": 22,\n    \"updated\": false\n}','2026-07-09 06:20:45.877135',22,_binary ''),(8,'Chaitanya','If user dont want to pass optional fields [ Priority , Status ] then just have to remove them from request paylaod.\nPFA sample payload without them.\n{\n  \"title\":\"SELFTEST INITIAL DEV\",\n  \"description\":\"HLSW500 REQ IS TESTED\",\n  \"taskType\": \"STORY\",\n  \"assignee\":\"SANKALP\",\n  \"reporter\":\"CHAITANYA\",\n  \"createdBy\":\"CHAITANYA\" ,\n	 \"projectId\": 1\n}','2026-07-10 16:24:42.236990',17,_binary ''),(9,'Chaitanya','This issue  is fixed.\nWhile testing this issue we got another issue mention below.\n**TASK-27**','2026-07-10 17:48:56.731417',14,_binary ''),(10,'sankalp boradkar','Issue has been resolved , please retest :)\nTry the following payload.\n```\n{\n \"assignee\": \"SANKALP\",\n  \"reporter\": \"CHAITANYA\"\n}\n```','2026-07-12 11:38:31.576891',26,_binary ''),(11,'sankalp boradkar','Fixed the issue.\nUsed Payload:\n```\n{\n  \"title\": \"SELFTEST INITIAL DEV\",\n  \"description\": \"HLSW500 REQ IS TESTED\",\n  \"taskType\": \"BUG\",\n  \"assignee\": \"SANKALP\",\n  \"reporter\": \"CHAITANYA\",\n  \"createdBy\": \"CHAITANYA\",\n  \"projectId\": 1\n}\n```\n\nResponse:\n\n```\n{\n  \"tasks\": {\n    \"id\": 30,\n    \"title\": \"SELFTEST INITIAL DEV\",\n    \"description\": \"HLSW500 REQ IS TESTED\",\n    \"taskType\": \"BUG\",\n    \"assignee\": null,\n    \"reporter\": \"sankalp boradkar\",\n    \"taskStatus\": \"TO_DO\",\n    \"priority\": \"LOW\",\n    \"createdAt\": \"2026-07-12T17:50:31.423738\",\n    \"createdBy\": \"sankalp boradkar\",\n    \"comments\": [],\n    \"parentTask\": null,\n    \"subIssues\": []\n  }\n}\n```','2026-07-12 12:21:58.827417',27,_binary ''),(12,'sankalp boradkar','```\n{\n  \"tasks\": {\n    \"id\": 30,\n    \"title\": \"SELFTEST INITIAL DEV\",\n    \"description\": \"HLSW500 REQ IS TESTED\",\n    \"taskType\": \"BUG\",\n    \"assignee\": null,\n    \"reporter\": \"sankalp boradkar\",\n    \"taskStatus\": \"TO_DO\",\n    \"priority\": \"LOW\",\n    \"createdAt\": \"2026-07-12T17:50:31.423738\",\n    \"createdBy\": \"sankalp boradkar\",\n    \"comments\": [],\n    \"parentTask\": null,\n    \"subIssues\": []\n  }\n}\n```','2026-07-12 12:40:53.463877',26,_binary ''),(13,'sankalp boradkar','**Response Code:** 500\n**Response:** \n```\n{\n  \"timestamp\": \"2026-07-12T13:15:55.674+00:00\",\n  \"status\": 500,\n  \"error\": \"Internal Server Error\",\n  \"path\": \"/api/tasks/update/26\"\n}\n```','2026-07-12 13:16:43.903340',26,_binary ''),(14,'User','This issue is fixed','2026-07-14 14:43:20.669634',27,_binary '\0'),(15,'User','After retesting i m getting 500 as response code .','2026-07-14 14:48:05.078666',26,_binary ''),(16,'User','Now API is returning correct 404 if un available task ID is fetched by user.\n\nRequest:\n**http://localhost:8080/api/tasks/get/created-task?taskId=100**\n\nResponse:\n\n```\n{\n  \"error\": \"Task not found with task ID: 100\",\n  \"fieldErrors\": null\n}\n```','2026-07-14 16:42:36.260056',42,_binary ''),(17,'User','Hi,\nCase I -- Invalid project ID\nAPI earlier was returning 500 now its returning 404 with proper message.\n\nSample Request:\n```\n{\n  \"title\":\"MAINMENU INITIAL DEV\",\n  \"description\":\"HLSW501 REQ IS TESTED\",\n  \"taskType\":\"STORY\",\n  \"assignee\":\"boradkarsankalp6@gmail.com\",\n  \"reporter\":\"cppofley@gmail.com\",\n  \"taskStatus\":\"IN_PROGRESS\",\n  \"priority\":\"LOW\",\n  \"projectId\": 26\n}\n```\n\nResponse Code: 404\n\nResponse:\n```\n{\n  \"error\": \"There is not active project 26 to map this task.\",\n  \"fieldErrors\": null\n}\n```','2026-07-14 17:42:42.094368',37,_binary '\0'),(18,'User','Case II Invalid assignee / reporter syntax\n\nAPI eralier was giving 500 but now its returning 400 with correct message\n\nSample Request:\n```\n{\n  \"title\":\"MAINMENU INITIAL DEV\",\n  \"description\":\"HLSW501 REQ IS TESTED\",\n  \"taskType\":\"STORY\",\n  \"assignee\":\"boradkarsankalp6\",\n  \"reporter\":\"cppofley@gmail.com\",\n  \"taskStatus\":\"IN_PROGRESS\",\n  \"priority\":\"LOW\",\n  \"projectId\": 26\n}\n```\n\nSample Response:\n```\n{\n  \"error\": \"Reporter must be a strictly valid email address (e.g., user@domain.com)\",\n  \"fieldErrors\": null\n}\n```','2026-07-14 17:44:48.631351',37,_binary '\0'),(19,'User','Issue1 is fixed.\n**REQUEST BODY:**\n{\n  \"title\":\"MAINMENU INITIAL DEV\",\n  \"description\":\"HLSW501 REQ IS TESTED\",\n  \"taskType\":\"STORY\",\n  \"assignee\":\"boradkarsankalp6@gmail.com\",\n  \"reporter\":\"cppofley@gmail.com\",\n  \"taskStatus\":\"IN_PROGRESS\",\n  \"priority\":\"LOW\",\n  \"projectId\": 26\n}\n\n**RESPONSE BODY**\n\n  \"error\": \"There is not active project 26 to map this task.\",\n  \"fieldErrors\": null\n}\n**Response  code** :404.\n\nIssue 2 is fixed.\n\n**REQUEST BODY:**\n\n{\n  \"title\":\"MAINMENU INITIAL DEV\",\n  \"description\":\"HLSW501 REQ IS TESTED\",\n  \"taskType\":\"STORY\",\n  \"assignee\":\"SANKALP\",\n  \"reporter\":\"CHAITANYA\",\n  \"taskStatus\":\"IN_PROGRESS\",\n  \"priority\":\"LOW\",\n  \"projectId\": 1\n}\n**RESPONSE BODY:**\n{\n  \"error\": \"Invalid reporter email syntax\",\n  \"fieldErrors\": null\n}\n\n**RESPONSE CODE**:400','2026-07-16 17:36:15.260595',37,_binary ''),(20,'User','This issue is fixed\nGiven task id ==43\n\nresponse code--404\nresponse body--\n```\n{\n  \"error\": \"Task not found with task ID: 43\",\n  \"fieldErrors\": null\n}\n```','2026-07-16 17:39:50.636437',42,_binary ''),(21,'User','**This feature is ready for UAT**','2026-07-16 18:20:01.595757',41,_binary '\0'),(24,'User','http://localhost:8080/api/users/by-email/boradkarsankalp6%40gmail.com\n\nResponse:\n```\n{\n  \"username\": \"sankalp boradkar\",\n  \"email\": \"boradkarsankalp6@gmail.com\",\n  \"pictureUrl\": \"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocJyApf2WpAokA6CVvqrq-tNOKaTFk6LaadKLVEobFFIhIWUEVq3Eg=s96-c\"\n}\n```','2026-07-18 23:46:11.799521',55,_binary '\0'),(25,'User','Done','2026-07-18 23:46:30.114712',54,_binary '\0'),(26,'User','It is fixed now','2026-07-18 23:49:28.604692',50,_binary '\0'),(27,'User','try it','2026-07-19 00:08:01.297581',50,_binary '\0'),(28,'User','http://localhost:8080/api/tasks/get/created-task?taskId=50\n\nResponse:\n\n```\n{\n  \"id\": 50,\n  \"title\": \"Error on fetching comment and sub tasks for an current task\",\n  \"description\": \"\",\n  \"taskType\": \"BUG\",\n  \"assignee\": \"sankalp boradkar\",\n  \"reporter\": \"sankalp boradkar\",\n  \"taskStatus\": \"IN_PROGRESS\",\n  \"priority\": \"CRITICAL\",\n  \"createdAt\": \"2026-07-18T22:21:13.264757\",\n  \"comments\": [\n    {\n      \"id\": 26,\n      \"comment\": \"It is fixed now\",\n      \"author\": \"User\",\n      \"taskId\": null\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": 27,\n      \"comment\": \"try it\",\n      \"author\": \"User\",\n      \"taskId\": null\n    }\n  ],\n  \"parentTask\": {\n    \"id\": 41,\n    \"title\": \"/api/tasks/get/created-task\",\n    \"taskType\": \"STORY\"\n  },\n  \"subIssues\": []\n}\n```','2026-07-19 00:08:45.412750',50,_binary '\0'),(29,'sankalp boradkar','Fixed it as a part of PR: \nhttps://github.com/CPofley/Jira-Core/pull/10\n\nBut instead of adding cacheEvict, planning on caching taskDto instead of taskId because of which we are getting this exception.\nWill create a new task for it.','2026-07-30 17:06:54.480463',99,_binary '\0'),(30,'sankalp boradkar','It is fixed as part of PR: https://github.com/CPofley/Jira-Core/pull/10\n\nDo a retest','2026-08-04 01:39:37.436333',104,_binary '\0'),(31,'sankalp boradkar','Testr automation framework development is in progress','2026-08-04 17:23:20.482048',12,_binary '\0');
