INSERT INTO `tasks` (`id`, `created_at`, `description`, `priority`, `status`, `type`, `title`, `parent_id`, `assignee_id`, `reporter_id`, `project_id`, `updated_at`, `updated_by_user`) VALUES (12,'2026-07-07 16:47:55.731075','Optional Fields: [ Status, Description, Priority, Assignee ]\nMandatory Fields: [ Issue Type, Summary, Reporter, Created By ]\nBusiness Requirement--\n1. When user does not pass optional fields then the task should get saved\n2. When user does not pass all the mandatory fields then task should not be saved\n3. API should return task ID for recently created task\n4. Should return user friendly error message when API fails.\n5. When user is not sending priority in create request then system shd assign default value as  Priority = LOW.\n6. When user is not sending assignee then default assignee should be null.\n7. When user is not sending status then default status should be TO_DO.\n8. When user is not sending Description then default description to null.\n9. When un registered reporter email been sent while creating task then api should give error 400.\n10. Un availble project ID should gi e 404 while creating a task.\n11. When user provides an invalid priority, the API should return a 404 response code\n12. When user provides an invalid task status, the API should return a 404 response code\n13. When user provides an invalid task type, the API should return a 404 response code\n\n',3,1,0,'Test /api/tasks/create',21,NULL,NULL,1,NULL,NULL),(14,'2026-07-08 17:36:16.951416','REQUEST:\n{\n  \"title\":\"SELFTEST INITIAL DEV\",\n  \"description\":,\n  \"taskType\":\"STORY\",\n  \"assignee\":\"SANKALP\",\n  \"reporter\":\"CHAITANYA\",\n  \"taskStatus\":,\n  \"priority\":\"LOW\",\n  \"createdBy\":\"CHAITANYA\" \n}\nRESPONSE:\n{\n  \"timestamp\": \"2026-07-08T17:33:41.303+00:00\",\n  \"status\": 400,\n  \"error\": \"Bad Request\",\n  \"path\": \"/api/tasks/create\"\n}\nWhen submitting a request with all mandatory fields populated and optional fields left blank, the API returns a 400 Bad Request error. It should return a 200 OK success response along with the Task ID.\n\n',2,2,1,'API throws an error when optional fields are left blank',12,NULL,NULL,1,NULL,NULL),(17,'2026-07-08 17:42:20.583193','There is inconsistent validation behavior when submitting optional fields in the request payload.\n\nSteps to Reproduce:\nSend a request leaving Description and Assignee fields empty Returns 200 OK (Expected)\n.Send a request leaving TASKSTATUS and PRIORITY fields empty Returns 400 Bad Request (Bug).\n\nExpected Result:\nAll optional fields should behave consistently. If TASKSTATUS and PRIORITY are optional, the API should accept them as empty and return a 200 OK response.\n\nActual Result:\nThe API rejects empty TASKSTATUS or PRIORITY fields with a 400 Bad Request error.',2,2,1,'API returns 400 instead of 200 when empty TASKSTATUS or PRIORITY fields are sent',12,NULL,NULL,1,NULL,NULL),(21,'2026-07-09 05:56:22.150084','Initial API Development',3,1,3,'Initial API Developemnt',NULL,NULL,NULL,1,NULL,NULL),(22,'2026-07-09 06:16:17.794884','Test /api/comments/save API\n/api/comments/save -- It helps in adding a comment to a task.\nThis story aims to test the comment creation process. Please find the sample request response attached in the comment.',1,0,0,'Test /api/comments/save',21,NULL,NULL,1,NULL,NULL),(23,'2026-07-09 18:17:58.927518','',1,1,0,'Test OAuth',21,1,1,1,NULL,NULL),(24,'2026-07-10 02:42:00.053183','5 req are pariatilly developed and other 5 are completely tested.',1,1,0,'SelfTest Initial Development',NULL,1,2,5,NULL,NULL),(26,'2026-07-10 16:49:48.752662','Even after authentication still I m getting response code as 401.',2,2,1,'401 On authenticated PATCH call via swagger when updating asignee/reporter',28,NULL,1,1,NULL,NULL),(27,'2026-07-10 17:07:13.362216','When creating a new task via the API, omitting the optional priority field results in the task being saved with a null priority. The system should automatically assign a default priority of LOW when no value is provided.\n\nSteps to Reproduce:\n\nSend a POST request to create a task without including the priority field in the payload:\n\nJSON\n{\n  \"title\": \"SELFTEST INITIAL DEV\",\n  \"description\": \"HLSW500 REQ IS TESTED\",\n  \"taskType\": \"STORY\",\n  \"assignee\": \"SANKALP\",\n  \"reporter\": \"CHAITANYA\",\n  \"createdBy\": \"CHAITANYA\",\n  \"projectId\": 1\n}\nReceive a successful response returning the new task ID (e.g., 26).\n\nSend a GET request to fetch the newly created task: /api/tasks/get/created-task?taskId=26\n\nObserve the priority field in the response.\n\nExpected Behavior:\nThe priority field should be set to \"LOW\".\n\nActual Behavior:\nThe priority field is currently returning as null.',2,2,1,'Default Priority is setting as null',12,1,1,1,NULL,NULL),(28,'2026-07-12 11:36:10.966911','# This story aims to test the full functionality of the following API.\n**API URL:** /api/tasks/update/\n**API Type:** PATCH\n**Sample API:** http://localhost:8080/api/tasks/update/26\n**Fields availbe to update:** [Title, Description, Assignee, Reporter, Task Status, Priority, Task Type]\n**Sample Payload:**\n```\n{\n  \"title\": \"SELFTEST INITIAL DEV\",\n  \"description\": \"HLSW500 REQ IS TESTED\"\n}\n```\n**Sample Response:**\n```\n{\n  \"id\": 26,\n  \"title\": \"SELFTEST INITIAL DEV\",\n  \"description\": \"HLSW500 REQ IS TESTED\",\n  \"taskType\": \"BUG\",\n  \"assignee\": null,\n  \"reporter\": \"sankalp boradkar\",\n  \"taskStatus\": \"DONE\",\n  \"priority\": \"HIGH\",\n  \"createdAt\": \"2026-07-10T22:19:48.752662\",\n  \"createdBy\": \"sankalp boradkar\",\n  \"comments\": [\n    {\n      \"id\": 10,\n      \"comment\": \"Issue has been resolved , please retest :)\\nTry the following payload.\\n```\\n{\\n \\\"assignee\\\": \\\"SANKALP\\\",\\n  \\\"reporter\\\": \\\"CHAITANYA\\\"\\n}\\n```\",\n      \"author\": \"sankalp boradkar\",\n      \"taskId\": null\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": 12,\n      \"comment\": \"\\n{\\n  \\\"tasks\\\": {\\n    \\\"id\\\": 30,\\n    \\\"title\\\": \\\"SELFTEST INITIAL DEV\\\",\\n    \\\"description\\\": \\\"HLSW500 REQ IS TESTED\\\",\\n    \\\"taskType\\\": \\\"BUG\\\",\\n    \\\"assignee\\\": null,\\n    \\\"reporter\\\": \\\"sankalp boradkar\\\",\\n    \\\"taskStatus\\\": \\\"TO_DO\\\",\\n    \\\"priority\\\": \\\"LOW\\\",\\n    \\\"createdAt\\\": \\\"2026-07-12T17:50:31.423738\\\",\\n    \\\"createdBy\\\": \\\"sankalp boradkar\\\",\\n    \\\"comments\\\": [],\\n    \\\"parentTask\\\": null,\\n    \\\"subIssues\\\": []\\n  }\\n}\\n\",\n      \"author\": \"sankalp boradkar\",\n      \"taskId\": null\n    }\n  ],\n  \"parentTask\": {\n    \"id\": 28,\n    \"title\": \"Test /api/tasks/update\",\n    \"taskType\": \"STORY\"\n  },\n  \"subIssues\": []\n}\n```\n\n\n',2,0,0,'Test /api/tasks/update',21,NULL,1,1,NULL,NULL),(37,'2026-07-14 15:17:07.631463','ISSUE1:\nActual: While sending this below payload I m receiving response code as 500 \nExpected: response code as 404.\n\nrequest body:\n```\n{\n  \"title\":\"MAINMENU INITIAL DEV\",\n  \"description\":\"HLSW501 REQ IS TESTED\",\n  \"taskType\":\"STORY\",\n  \"assignee\":\"boradkarsankalp6@gmail.com\",\n  \"reporter\":\"cppofley@gmail.com\",\n  \"taskStatus\":\"IN_PROGRESS\",\n  \"priority\":\"LOW\",\n  \"projectId\": 26\n}\n```\n\nISSUE2:\nAPI returns 500 Internal Server Error instead of 400 Bad Request when passing a Name instead of an Email ID for Assignee/Reporter\n\nrequest body:\n```\n{\n  \"title\":\"MAINMENU INITIAL DEV\",\n  \"description\":\"HLSW501 REQ IS TESTED\",\n  \"taskType\":\"STORY\",\n  \"assignee\":\"Sankalp\",\n  \"reporter\":\"Chaitanya\",\n  \"taskStatus\":\"IN_PROGRESS\",\n  \"priority\":\"LOW\",\n  \"projectId\": 1\n}\n```',2,2,1,'Common Bugs related to Create API',12,1,2,1,NULL,NULL),(41,'2026-07-14 15:38:20.526839','This API aims to get details of the created task.\n\n**Business Requirements:**\n1. API should return 401 id user is not authenticated\n2. API should give 200 status code when user is authenticated and passing correct task ID to fetch the data.\n3. API should return exactly same data which was sent as part of CREATE api.\n4. API should return 404 if there is no data with input task ID\n\n**Future Scope**\n1. API should give 403 if the task ID does not belong to specific project ID\n\n**Sample Request:**\nhttp://localhost:8080/api/tasks/get/created-task?taskId=41\n\n**Sample Response:**\n```\n{\n  \"tasks\": {\n    \"id\": 26,\n    \"title\": \"401 On authenticated PATCH call via swagger when updating asignee/reporter\",\n    \"description\": \"Even after authentication still I m getting response code as 401.\",\n    \"taskType\": \"BUG\",\n    \"assignee\": null,\n    \"reporter\": \"sankalp boradkar\",\n    \"taskStatus\": \"DONE\",\n    \"priority\": \"HIGH\",\n    \"createdAt\": \"2026-07-10T22:19:48.752662\",\n    \"comments\": [\n      {\n        \"id\": 10,\n        \"comment\": \"Issue has been resolved , please retest :)\\nTry the following payload.\\n```\\n{\\n \\\"assignee\\\": \\\"SANKALP\\\",\\n  \\\"reporter\\\": \\\"CHAITANYA\\\"\\n}\\n```\",\n        \"author\": \"sankalp boradkar\",\n        \"taskId\": null\n      },\n      {\n        \"id\": 12,\n        \"comment\": \"```\\n{\\n  \\\"tasks\\\": {\\n    \\\"id\\\": 30,\\n    \\\"title\\\": \\\"SELFTEST INITIAL DEV\\\",\\n    \\\"description\\\": \\\"HLSW500 REQ IS TESTED\\\",\\n    \\\"taskType\\\": \\\"BUG\\\",\\n    \\\"assignee\\\": null,\\n    \\\"reporter\\\": \\\"sankalp boradkar\\\",\\n    \\\"taskStatus\\\": \\\"TO_DO\\\",\\n    \\\"priority\\\": \\\"LOW\\\",\\n    \\\"createdAt\\\": \\\"2026-07-12T17:50:31.423738\\\",\\n    \\\"createdBy\\\": \\\"sankalp boradkar\\\",\\n    \\\"comments\\\": [],\\n    \\\"parentTask\\\": null,\\n    \\\"subIssues\\\": []\\n  }\\n}\\n```\",\n        \"author\": \"sankalp boradkar\",\n        \"taskId\": null\n      },\n      {\n        \"id\": 13,\n        \"comment\": \"**Response Code:** 500\\n**Response:** \\n```\\n{\\n  \\\"timestamp\\\": \\\"2026-07-12T13:15:55.674+00:00\\\",\\n  \\\"status\\\": 500,\\n  \\\"error\\\": \\\"Internal Server Error\\\",\\n  \\\"path\\\": \\\"/api/tasks/update/26\\\"\\n}\\n```\",\n        \"author\": \"sankalp boradkar\",\n        \"taskId\": null\n      },\n      {\n        \"id\": 15,\n        \"comment\": \"After retesting i m getting 500 as response code .\",\n        \"author\": \"User\",\n        \"taskId\": null\n      }\n    ],\n    \"parentTask\": {\n      \"id\": 28,\n      \"title\": \"Test /api/tasks/update\",\n      \"taskType\": \"STORY\"\n    },\n    \"subIssues\": []\n  }\n}\n```\n',2,1,0,'/api/tasks/get/created-task',21,1,2,1,NULL,NULL),(42,'2026-07-14 15:45:27.487943','Issue: Incorrect error code for invalid taskId.\n\nSteps to Reproduce: Pass a non-existent taskId (e.g., 41) in the request.\n\nExpected Behavior: API should return 404 Not Found.\n\nActual Behavior: API returns 500 Internal Server Error.',2,2,1,'500 Status code while fetching task details of an unavailable task ID',41,1,2,1,NULL,NULL),(45,'2026-07-16 18:13:17.884902','ISSUE1:\nWhen the user provides an invalid priority, the API should return a 404 response code instead of returning a 500 response code.\n**REQUEST BODY:**\n```\n{\n  \"title\": \"selftest\",\n  \"description\": \"FAIL ISSUE\",\n  \"taskType\": \"STORY\",\n  \"assignee\": \"cppofley@gmail.com\",\n  \"reporter\": \"boradkarsankalp6@gmail.com\",\n  \"taskStatus\": \"TO_DO\",\n  \"priority\": \"MID-LOW\",\n  \"projectId\": 1\n}\n```\n\nISSUE2:\nWhen the user provides an invalid TASK TYPE, the API should return a 400 response code instead its returning 500 as the response code.\n\n**REQUEST BODY:**\n```\n{\n  \"title\": \"selftest\",\n  \"description\": \"FAIL ISSUE\",\n  \"taskType\": \"BUG-DEFECT\",\n  \"assignee\": \"cppofley@gmail.com\",\n  \"reporter\": \"boradkarsankalp6@gmail.com\",\n  \"taskStatus\": \"TO_DO\",\n  \"priority\": \"LOW\",\n  \"projectId\": 1\n}\n```\n\nISSUE3:\nWhen the user provides an invalid TASK STATUS, the API should return a 400 response code instead of returning a 500 response code.\n\n**REQUEST BODY:**\n```\n{\n  \"title\": \"selftest\",\n  \"description\": \"FAIL ISSUE\",\n  \"taskType\": \"STORY\",\n  \"assignee\": \"cppofley@gmail.com\",\n  \"reporter\": \"boradkarsankalp6@gmail.com\",\n  \"taskStatus\": \"NEED_TO_DO\",\n  \"priority\": \"LOW\",\n  \"projectId\": 1\n}\n```',1,2,1,'API returns 500 instead of 404 for invalid Priority, Task Status, or TaskType',12,1,1,1,NULL,NULL),(50,'2026-07-18 16:51:13.264757','',3,2,1,'Error on fetching comment and sub tasks for an current task',41,1,1,1,NULL,NULL),(51,'2026-07-18 17:41:29.753214','',3,2,1,'500 Error on deleting a task',12,1,1,1,NULL,NULL),(52,'2026-07-18 21:50:43.211478','Dashboard page redirection issue on deleting a task from Task Details page.',2,2,1,'Dashboard page redirection issue',53,1,1,1,NULL,NULL),(53,'2026-07-18 21:51:02.033874','',1,1,0,'UI Issues',NULL,1,1,1,NULL,NULL),(54,'2026-07-18 22:00:20.169061','',1,0,0,'Test api/users ',21,2,1,1,NULL,NULL),(55,'2026-07-18 22:01:32.481589','Create a new end point in USERS api to fetch the user\'s profile data.\nName\nEmail\nProfile Image Url',1,2,2,'Create a new end point in USERS api to fetch the user\'s data',54,2,1,1,NULL,NULL),(56,'2026-07-18 22:08:37.692015','',1,2,1,'Linked issues are not visible on parent task',12,1,1,1,NULL,NULL),(60,'2026-07-19 00:10:08.691711','',1,2,2,'Add profile image and name on all other pages UI',53,1,1,1,NULL,NULL),(66,'2026-07-22 15:39:42.366084','Create test automatoin suite for /api/tasks/create API matching all the requirements of parent story.',1,1,2,'Create test automatoin suite for /api/tasks/create API',12,2,1,1,NULL,NULL),(87,'2026-07-28 15:43:08.681218','Add EntityGraph implementation to get comments and sub-issues in get created-task api',1,2,2,'Add EntityGraph implementation to get commetns and sub issues',12,1,1,1,NULL,NULL),(88,'2026-07-29 01:03:29.664028','',1,0